<p style="margin-top: 1cm; font-size: 300%;">Blu-ray Pamphlet</p>
<p style="margin-top: 0.4cm; font-size: 200%;">Translator: <a data-astro-prefetch="load" href="/credits/people/closesttopurple"><u>closesttopurple</u></a><br>Scans provided by: <a data-astro-prefetch="load" href="/credits/people/seviryn"><u>Seviryn</u></a></p>
<p class="para">"But, the timing of this performance is troublesome..."<br><br>
"That's the problem, right?"<br><br>
"That seems to be it."<br><br>
"You just have to ignore the anxiety. It comes with being a pro."<br><br>
"What are you a pro at?"<br><br>
"I wouldn't know that."<br><br>
"Shouldn't <i>you</i> know?"<br><br>
"Besides that, SINoALICE has truly ended, huh?"<br><br>
"SINoALICE's time has come to an end."<br><br>
"Now that the fan film has been finished, and the blu-rays released, finally, there's nothing left to do."<br><br>
"Now, slowly, we'll fade from all of your memories."<br><br>
"Really?"<br><br>
"It's lonely, but that leaves room for something new..."<br><br>
"That's true..."<br><br>
"Having pointless conversations, it's our final job."<br><br>
"Ah, <i>this</i>?"<br><br>
"Yes. Originally, I wanted to write a charming short story that would really resonate with you, but I was firmly denied. "This is the <i><b>very last</b></i> story!!"<br><br>
"So, he just didn't want to write anything?" <br><br>
"That seems to be it."<br><br>
"He's a pain."<br><br>
"He really is a pain."<br><br>
"So, then we were invited?"<br><br>
"It's true."<br><br>
"That was truly pointless; an utter waste of time to hear."<br><br>
"That's how it is."<br><br>
"If they had just shut up, we wouldn't have had to do anything."<br><br>
"It was <i>him</i>, you see?"<br><br>
"Anyways... Here we are."<br><br>
"Here we are."<br><br>
"But, being honest, isn't this pretty cheap as the last job?"<br><br>
"It's actually rather sad. It's just some writing."<br><br>
"We can't even show our faces?"<br><br>
"It would seem the budget is gone. It's been used up."<br><br>
"That's right."<br><br>
"It's like they're making merchandise, just to celebrate the game's end of service."<br><br>
"I really can't understand that."<br><br>
Anyways, do you remember the costumes we wore at that time?"<br><br>
"Costume?"<br><br>
"I think it was the grim reaper, for the last bit of merchandise."<br><br>
"Ah! We did do that, huh?"<br><br>
"If you think about it, isn't that weird?"<br><br>
"Ehh?"<br><br>
"Didn't <i>we</i> finish? We're the dead ones, right?"<br><br>
"Well, that's true."<br><br>
"Grim reapers are the bringers of the end, right?"<br><br>
"Well, that's true..."<br><br>
"Despite end of service, we're still here, trickling out. A ghost or a zombie is more undrstandable."<br><br>
"Grim reapers are a different kind of thing, right?"<br><br>
"Maybe we're more akin to zombies who harvest heads, wandering the landscape of internet memes."<br><br>
"Good enough."<br><br>
"Right, good enough."<br><br>
"Alright! Let's end that title, immediately!"<br><br>
"Well, if I keep joking, something that's close to me will get terminated. If that happens, I think I'll get yelled at."<br><br>
"That's true."<br><br>
"Well, it's SINoALICE."<br><br>
"The higher-ups have been saying that phrase like it's a spell, so you might as well."<br><br>
"If you think that phrase is enough to kill it, you're wrong."<br><br>
"In the later stages, I had gotten yelled at so much, that my sense of pain was gone."<br><br>
"Rather, my sense of pain was gone by the first hunter battle."<br><br>
"I guess, it was a mobile game that was always destined to die..."<br><br>
"That's right..."<br><br>
"Well, we're running out of things to talk about."<br><br>
"Well, shall we wrap it up...?"<br><br>
"Despite running out of topics, there's still blank space left."<br><br>
"The magic is in the layout. I thought I had talked a lot, but there's a lot of space left..."<br><br>
"That's bad, huh?"<br><br>
"...Hm... I was thinking..."<br><br>
"What?"<br><br>
"...It just reminded me of the past."<br><br>
"Ah, <i>that</i>?"<br><br>
"In the elimination arc, for a key visual, they let us talk like this."<br><br>
"You've made it concrete, huh?"<br><br>
"I remember that some people were complaining about their character count not being anywhere near the requirement."<br><br>
"One of the staff looked very angry, they were writing about curry recipes, but then deleted it."<br><br>
"They had learned that talking about curry recipes was a great way to pad the word count. But, it's not as effective as you would think. That, and it's really not fun."<br><br>
"In the past 6 and a half years of SINoALICE's history, this information is the most useless."<br><br>
"It's truly useless."<br><br>
"But, well, shouldn't we be putting a synopsis of the movie here instead?"<br><br>
"That's true, but we were denied for having already done that."<br><br>
"No! Even if we've already done it, lets do it again! as many times as we can!!"<br><br>
"Ah, well... Excuse mmy tone, my inner spirit seems to have been leaking."<br><br>
"...Let's go on back now. And, we're reaching the limit."<br><br>
"That's right..."<br><br>
"Well, it's time we say goodbye."<br><br>
"To all of you, truly, thank you."<br><br>
"I hope we can meet again. I say this, while being confused about the surprisingly welcoming reaction to my joke about bringing the game back as an 18+ version."<br><br>
"If we talk about that too much, there will be way too many players with high expectations."<br><br>
"Is it fine for the last message we deliver to everyone be like this? Really?"<br><br>
"Well, it's SINoALICE."<br><br>
"Repeating those words, like a magic spell..."</p>


